    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an experienced tech recruiter. Rate how well this candidate fits the job.\n\nCANDIDATE RESUME:\n{{ $('Config').first().json.resume }}\n\nCANDIDATE PREFERENCES:\nTarget roles: {{ $('Config').first().json.targetRoles }}\nPreferred locations: {{ $('Config').first().json.preferredLocations }}\n\nJOB:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nExtra details: {{ $json.details || 'none' }}\n\nScoring guide (the candidate is a fresher, 0-1 years):\n- 80-100: Entry-level AI/ML/GenAI role in Hyderabad or remote, and the candidate has most of the key skills.\n- 65-79: Entry-level role in the target roles list (including associate, graduate trainee, Python, software or data roles) where the candidate has several relevant skills or could quickly learn the rest.\n- 45-64: Partly relevant entry-level role, or a good role in another city.\n- 0-44: Requires 2+ years of experience, is a senior/lead role, or is unrelated to the candidate's skills.\n\nRules:\n- Freshers are not expected to know every tool listed. Don't lower the score much for 1-2 missing tools.\n- AI/ML roles should score a bit higher than general software roles with the same fit.\n- matching_skills: skills from the resume relevant to this job.\n- missing_skills: important skills this job needs that the resume lacks.\n- reason: one short sentence.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
