        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short, genuine cover letter (120-170 words) for this job application.\n\nRules:\n- Plain text only. No placeholders like [Company] or [Your Name].\n- Sign off with the candidate's real name from the resume.\n- Mention 2-3 specific skills or projects from the resume that fit this job.\n- Sound human and confident. Avoid cliches like \"I am writing to express my interest\".\n- Do not claim skills the resume doesn't show.\n\nRESUME:\n{{ $('Config').first().json.resume }}\n\nJOB:\n{{ $json.title }} at {{ $json.company }} ({{ $json.location || 'location not given' }})\nDetails: {{ $json.details || 'none' }}\nRelevant skills: {{ ($json.matching_skills || []).join(', ') }}",
